A --remove drops the named key from the frontmatter, leaving the other keys and the body
untouched.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
business_goal: Users find widgets faster.
status: backlog
---
# My Plan

- [ ] 3 SP: Task one
- [ ] 2 SP: Task two
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md --remove business_goal
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,6 +1,5 @@
 ---
 title: Foo
-business_goal: Users find widgets faster.
 status: backlog
 ---
 # My Plan
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: -business_goal
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: backlog
---
# My Plan

- [ ] 3 SP: Task one
- [ ] 2 SP: Task two
